{"id":"8d1853eb0947b911","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-kripke-platek.md","title":"Kripke–Platek 公理编码","display":"df-kripke-platek — Kripke–Platek 公理编码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-kripke-platek","aliases":["58-df-kripke-platek"],"display":"df-kripke-platek — Kripke–Platek 公理编码","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-kripke-platek"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-kripke-platek</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kripke-platek — Kripke–Platek 公理编码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60d957ce43061cb6\" href=\"?note=60d957ce43061cb6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md\">../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\)</span>；变量编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>），公式编码、构造子与自由变量集采用依赖文件中的定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 表示由这些构造子形成的公式编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span> 在引号内表示代入该公式编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z,a,b\">\\(x,y,z,a,b\\)</span> 表示变量编码；四个固定公理内不同字母取互异编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[y/x]=\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi,y,x)\">\\(\\varphi[y/x]=\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi,y,x)\\)</span>，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(y,x,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(y,x,\\varphi)\\)</span> 成立时使用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\land\\psi:=\\neg(\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\neg\\psi)\">\\(\\varphi\\land\\psi:=\\neg(\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\neg\\psi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\to\\psi:=\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\to\\psi:=\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi:=(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\varphi)\">\\(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi:=(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\varphi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\varphi:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\exists x\\varphi:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in y\\,\\varphi:=\\forall x(x\\dot\\in y\\to\\varphi)\">\\(\\forall x\\in y\\,\\varphi:=\\forall x(x\\dot\\in y\\to\\varphi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\in y\\,\\varphi:=\\exists x(x\\dot\\in y\\land\\varphi)\">\\(\\exists x\\in y\\,\\varphi:=\\exists x(x\\dot\\in y\\land\\varphi)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^{\\mathrm{KP}}_0\">\\(\\Delta^{\\mathrm{KP}}_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UC}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UC}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sep}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sep}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coll}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Coll}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KP}\">\\(\\operatorname{KP}\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UC}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UC}_S\\)</span> 是关系，包含按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,v_1,\\ldots\">\\(v_0,v_1,\\ldots\\)</span> 顺序补足自由变量的所有有限全称闭包。</li>\n<li>为补齐可接受性接口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KP}\">\\(\\operatorname{KP}\\)</span> 在此采用不加入无穷公理的约定；其公理为外延、空集、配对、并集、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 分离、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 收集及全公式集合归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KP}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{KP}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 表示同一组编码所解码的公理实例，不表示另一个未指定的理论。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kp\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nD_0&amp;=\\{\\ulcorner x\\doteq y\\urcorner,\\ulcorner x\\dot\\in y\\urcorner:x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\\\\nD_{n+1}&amp;=D_n\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in D_n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner:\\varphi,\\psi\\in D_n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\in y\\,\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\exists x\\in y\\,\\varphi\\urcorner:\n\\varphi\\in D_n\\land x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land x\\ne y\\},\\\\\n\\Delta^{\\mathrm{KP}}_0&amp;=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D_n,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\{\\in\\}}&amp;=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in}):\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kp\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}formulas}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nD_0&amp;=\\{\\ulcorner x\\doteq y\\urcorner,\\ulcorner x\\dot\\in y\\urcorner:x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\\\\nD_{n+1}&amp;=D_n\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in D_n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner:\\varphi,\\psi\\in D_n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\in y\\,\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\exists x\\in y\\,\\varphi\\urcorner:\n\\varphi\\in D_n\\land x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land x\\ne y\\},\\\\\n\\Delta^{\\mathrm{KP}}_0&amp;=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D_n,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\{\\in\\}}&amp;=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in}):\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kp\\text{-}universal\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UC}_S(\\psi,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\land\n\\psi=\\ulcorner\\forall v_0\\cdots\\forall v_{n-1}\\,\\varphi\\urcorner\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kp\\text{-}universal\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UC}_S(\\psi,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\land\n\\psi=\\ulcorner\\forall v_0\\cdots\\forall v_{n-1}\\,\\varphi\\urcorner\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kp\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sep}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S(\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Delta^{\\mathrm{KP}}_0\\;\\exists x,a,b\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\Bigl(|\\{x,a,b\\}|=3\\land\\{a,b\\}\\cap\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\land\n\\mathrm{UC}_S\\bigl(\\psi,\\ulcorner\\forall a\\,\\exists b\\,\\forall x\\,\n(x\\dot\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\dot\\in a\\land\\varphi))\\urcorner\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kp\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sep}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S(\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Delta^{\\mathrm{KP}}_0\\;\\exists x,a,b\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\Bigl(|\\{x,a,b\\}|=3\\land\\{a,b\\}\\cap\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\land\n\\mathrm{UC}_S\\bigl(\\psi,\\ulcorner\\forall a\\,\\exists b\\,\\forall x\\,\n(x\\dot\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\dot\\in a\\land\\varphi))\\urcorner\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kp\\text{-}collection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Coll}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S(\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Delta^{\\mathrm{KP}}_0\\;\\exists x,y,a,b\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\Bigl(|\\{x,y,a,b\\}|=4\\land\\{a,b\\}\\cap\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\land\n\\mathrm{UC}_S\\bigl(\\psi,\\ulcorner\\forall a\\,\n((\\forall x\\in a\\,\\exists y\\,\\varphi)\\to\n\\exists b\\,\\forall x\\in a\\,\\exists y\\in b\\,\\varphi)\\urcorner\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kp\\text{-}collection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Coll}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S(\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Delta^{\\mathrm{KP}}_0\\;\\exists x,y,a,b\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\Bigl(|\\{x,y,a,b\\}|=4\\land\\{a,b\\}\\cap\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\land\n\\mathrm{UC}_S\\bigl(\\psi,\\ulcorner\\forall a\\,\n((\\forall x\\in a\\,\\exists y\\,\\varphi)\\to\n\\exists b\\,\\forall x\\in a\\,\\exists y\\in b\\,\\varphi)\\urcorner\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kp\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ind}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S(\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\;\\exists x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\Bigl(x\\ne y\\land y\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}(\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(y,x,\\varphi)\\land\n\\mathrm{UC}_S\\bigl(\\psi,\\ulcorner\n(\\forall x\\,((\\forall y\\in x\\,\\varphi[y/x])\\to\\varphi))\n\\to\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kp\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ind}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S(\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\;\\exists x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\Bigl(x\\ne y\\land y\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}(\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(y,x,\\varphi)\\land\n\\mathrm{UC}_S\\bigl(\\psi,\\ulcorner\n(\\forall x\\,((\\forall y\\in x\\,\\varphi[y/x])\\to\\varphi))\n\\to\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}platek}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{KP}={}&amp;\\bigl\\{\n\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\,((\\forall z\\,(z\\dot\\in x\\leftrightarrow z\\dot\\in y))\\to x\\doteq y)\\urcorner,\\\\\n&amp;\\ulcorner\\exists x\\,\\forall y\\,\\neg(y\\dot\\in x)\\urcorner,\\\\\n&amp;\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\,\\exists z\\,\\forall a\\,(a\\dot\\in z\\leftrightarrow(a\\doteq x\\lor a\\doteq y))\\urcorner,\\\\\n&amp;\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\exists y\\,\\forall z\\,(z\\dot\\in y\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\,(a\\dot\\in x\\land z\\dot\\in a))\\urcorner\n\\bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\{\\in\\}}:\n\\mathrm{Sep}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S(\\psi)\\lor\\mathrm{Coll}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S(\\psi)\\lor\\mathrm{Ind}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S(\\psi)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}platek}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{KP}={}&amp;\\bigl\\{\n\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\,((\\forall z\\,(z\\dot\\in x\\leftrightarrow z\\dot\\in y))\\to x\\doteq y)\\urcorner,\\\\\n&amp;\\ulcorner\\exists x\\,\\forall y\\,\\neg(y\\dot\\in x)\\urcorner,\\\\\n&amp;\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\,\\exists z\\,\\forall a\\,(a\\dot\\in z\\leftrightarrow(a\\doteq x\\lor a\\doteq y))\\urcorner,\\\\\n&amp;\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\exists y\\,\\forall z\\,(z\\dot\\in y\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\,(a\\dot\\in x\\land z\\dot\\in a))\\urcorner\n\\bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\{\\in\\}}:\n\\mathrm{Sep}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S(\\psi)\\lor\\mathrm{Coll}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S(\\psi)\\lor\\mathrm{Ind}^{\\mathrm{KP}}_S(\\psi)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>公理模式通过公式编码的集合给出。无穷公理的取舍在 Hypothesis 中固定，因此不依赖 Remark；这里的约定容许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\omega\">\\(L_\\omega\\)</span>，与既有“严格大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>”的调用相容；但原文没有唯一确定无穷公理的取舍。全称闭包关系可含重复的等价公理实例，但定义的是唯一确定的句子集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":